{1055}{Appleby is a disturbed hack. We have known each other since we were in short pants, when we were actually friends. As I began to patent my inventions, however, he became increasingly hostile.}{Appleby is a disturbed hack. We have known each other since we were in short pants, when we were actually friends. As I began to patent my inventions, however, he became increasingly hostile.}{}{115}{}{ }
{1056}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{1058}{ }
{1058}{He always was going on about how he was going to be a fabulously wealthy industrialist, but he's not very intelligent. At first it was sad, but he has become dangerously unhinged in recent years.}{He always was going on about how he was going to be a fabulously wealthy industrialist, but he's not very intelligent. At first it was sad, but he has become dangerously unhinged in recent years.}{}{116}{}{ }
{1059}{About that job you were speaking of ...}{}{5}{lf11 1}{120}{ }
{1060}{I'd like to ask you about this ring.}{}{5}{in 2804, lf12 1}{10}{ }
{1061}{I'd like to talk to you about a ring. [Describe the ring.]}{}{5}{ni 2804, lf12 1}{10}{ }
{1062}{Well, I just wanted to warn you. Goodbye.}{}{5}{lf12 1}{0}{lf 1 1, re +10 }
{1065}{Banished...by the gods...I did it to them. [He begins to cry, quietly.] I had always feared the worst ....}{Banished...by the gods...I did it to them. [He begins to cry, quietly.] I had always feared the worst ....}{}{117}{}{ }
{1066}{How did you become involved with dwarves?}{}{5}{}{-42}{ }
{1070}{Why, do you have something to hide? Perhaps you stole it - tell me, where did you get it?}{Why, do you have something to hide? Perhaps you stole it - tell me, where did you get it?}{}{118}{}{ }
{1071}{Calm down, I didn't steal it. How did you lose it?}{}{5}{}{1075}{ }
{1072}{I don't appreciate your accusations, old man.}{}{5}{}{1082}{re -5 }
{1075}{That is none of your affair. I ask you for the last time, where did you get the ring?}{That is none of your affair. I ask you for the last time, where did you get the ring?}{}{119}{}{ }
{1076}{A gnome gave it to me as he lay dying.}{}{5}{ra -5, ra -2}{20}{ }
{1077}{A strange looking fellow gave it to me.}{}{5}{ra 5}{30}{ }
{1078}{A strange looking gnome gave it to me as he lay dying.}{}{5}{ra 2}{30}{ }
{1079}{You'd do well to watch your tone. I'm asking the questions here.}{}{5}{}{1082}{re -5 }
{1082}{I'll ignore your disrespect once - provided you tell me you came by that ring.}{I'll ignore your disrespect once - provided you tell me you came by that ring.}{}{120}{}{ }
{1083}{A gnome gave it to me as he lay dying.}{}{5}{ra -5, ra -2}{20}{ }
{1084}{A strange looking fellow gave it to me.}{}{5}{ra 5}{30}{ }
{1085}{A strange looking gnome gave it to me as he lay dying.}{}{5}{ra 2}{30}{ }
{1086}{I'm going to whip your arrogance out of you, dog.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 1050 ,co}
{1090}{That is a long story, and one that does not concern you. Suffice it to say that it should have been in the possession of a dwarf.}{That is a long story, and one that does not concern you. Suffice it to say that it should have been in the possession of a dwarf.}{}{121}{}{ }
{1091}{Well, it wasn't a dwarf. Too skinny, and he had no beard.}{}{5}{}{60}{ }
{1095}{Stennar was an old friend of mine ... but for him to cut his beard ... by the gods! It's unthinkable! [He pauses.] But please, tell me, did he say anything to you before he died? Did he say anything about, uh... about me?}{Stennar was an old friend of mine ... but for him to cut his beard ... by the gods! It's unthinkable! [He pauses.] But please, tell me, did he say anything to you before he died? Did he say anything about, uh... about me?}{}{122}{}{ }
{1096}{He said he had escaped to warn us about the evil...}{}{5}{}{1330}{ }
{1100}{There's not much, really, as Chukka is given to overzealousness in his protection of my person. He rendered the interloper lifeless before I could question him. All he had on his person was an amulet bearing the symbol of the Molochean Hand, the eye in the hexagram.}{There's not much, really, as Chukka is given to overzealousness in his protection of my person. He rendered the interloper lifeless before I could question him. All he had on his person was an amulet bearing the symbol of the Molochean Hand, the eye in the hexagram.}{}{123}{}{gf1085 1 }
