{1239}{That is very interesting.}{}{5}{}{610}{ }
{1240}{Let us hope for both our sakes that they are mere pretenders to the name, then. I would be loathe to have the authentic Molocheans out for my blood.}{Let us hope for both our sakes that they are mere pretenders to the name, then. I would be loathe to have the authentic Molocheans out for my blood.}{}{137}{}{ }
{1244}{I will keep a watchful eye, then.}{}{5}{}{610}{ }
{1245}{Why are you troubling me about this again?}{Why are you troubling me about this again?}{}{138}{}{ }
{1246}{I want to know how you were involved with Stennar Rock Cutter.}{}{5}{}{1250}{ }
{1247}{Forgive my intrusion. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1250}{Stennar? I met him when I was a young man. It is quite the tale, actually.}{Stennar? I met him when I was a young man. It is quite the tale, actually.}{}{139}{}{ }
{1251}{I'm listening.}{}{5}{}{-42}{ }
{1252}{I must beg your forgiveness and take my leave.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1260}{That, that is quite the long tale... a tale of my shame, it is.}{That, that is quite the long tale... a tale of my shame, it is.}{}{140}{}{ }
{1261}{I'm listening.}{}{5}{}{-42}{ru2017 }
{1270}{He knew that ring would lend veracity to your tale. I gave Stennar that ring the last time I saw him. And now he is dead... [He pauses for a moment, perhaps to compose himself.] If only we knew what he meant by "the evil".}{He knew that ring would lend veracity to your tale. I gave Stennar that ring the last time I saw him. And now he is dead... [He pauses for a moment, perhaps to compose himself.] If only we knew what he meant by "the evil".}{}{141}{}{ }
{1272}{The Panarii think the "evil" refers to someone named Arronax.}{}{5}{gf2344 1}{1480}{ }
{1273}{I met a Panarii acolyte who thought it had some religious meaning.}{}{5}{gf2004 1, gf2344 0, pa-6409}{1490}{ }
{1274}{Virgil, here, thinks it has something to do with his religion.}{}{5}{gf2344 0, pa6409}{1490}{ }
{1278}{What can we do now?}{}{5}{gf1007 0, gf2004 0, gf2344 0, pa-6409}{1280}{ }
{1279}{What can we do now?}{}{5}{gf1007 1, gf2004 0, gf2344 0}{450}{ }
{1280}{There must be some clue left in the Black Mountain mines, I'm certain of this. You seem to be a resourceful individual, would you be interested in searching the mines for some clue as to their whereabouts? I would make it worth your while, I can assure you.}{There must be some clue left in the Black Mountain mines, I'm certain of this. You seem to be a resourceful individual, would you be interested in searching the mines for some clue as to their whereabouts? I would make it worth your while, I can assure you.}{}{142}{}{ }
{1281}{I am anxious to solve this conundrum, as well. I accept.}{}{5}{qb1014 1}{470}{qu1013 2 }
{1282}{I am anxious to solve this conundrum, as well. I accept.}{}{5}{qu1014 2}{470}{ }
{1283}{I'd like to ask you some further questions before I commit myself.}{}{5}{qb1014 1}{1290}{qu1013 1 }
{1284}{I'd like to ask you some further questions before I commit myself.}{}{5}{qu1014 2}{1290}{ }
{1288}{That sounds a bit too dangerous, to me. Good day, sir.}{}{5}{qu1014 2}{0}{ }
{1289}{That sounds a bit too dangerous, to me. Good day, sir.}{}{5}{qb1014 1}{0}{qu1013 1 }
{1290}{Of course. What do you wish to ask of me?}{Of course. What do you wish to ask of me?}{}{143}{}{ }
{1291}{You didn't actually invent the steam engine?}{}{5}{}{1035}{ }
{1292}{Why the need to impress the dwarves after they rejected you?}{}{5}{}{1320}{ }
{1293}{What can you tell me of the recent attempt on your life?}{}{5}{gf1028 1, lf15 0}{1130}{lf15 1 }
{1294}{Why do you suppose the Molochean Hand tried to kill us?}{}{5}{lf15 1}{1380}{ }
{1295}{Can you tell me about your business?}{}{5}{}{1395}{ }
{1307}{I've decided to explore the Black Mountain Clan mines for you.}{}{5}{qu1014 2, qb1013 1}{470}{ }
{1308}{I've decided to explore the Black Mountain Clan mines for you.}{}{5}{qb1014 1, qb1013 1}{470}{qu1013 2 }
{1309}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1310}{Such is the enthusiasm, or perhaps the impetuousness, of youth that I did not stop to consider the consequences of my actions. All I could see was a way to gain the respect of the dwarves. It was all that mattered.}{Such is the enthusiasm, or perhaps the impetuousness, of youth that I did not stop to consider the consequences of my actions. All I could see was a way to gain the respect of the dwarves. It was all that mattered.}{}{144}{}{ }
{1311}{It must be unsettling to get so much praise for the steam engine.}{}{5}{}{1038}{ }
{1320}{You don't understand, I was... I was orphaned at a young age. The dwarves represented everything I wanted my family to be - a tight knit clan. And the respect I had for their brilliance with technology... I made the mistake common to youth, I thought intelligence equaled compassion. I needed to belong, to find that I had some worth.}{You don't understand, I was... I was orphaned at a young age. The dwarves represented everything I wanted my family to be - a tight knit clan. And the respect I had for their brilliance with technology... I made the mistake common to youth, I thought intelligence equaled compassion. I needed to belong, to find that I had some worth.}{}{145}{}{ }
{1321}{You were orphaned? What happened?}{}{5}{}{1350}{ }
{1322}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1329}{I must take my leave, good sir.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1330}{The evil? What evil? And where did he escape from?}{The evil? What evil? And where did he escape from?}{}{146}{}{ }
{1331}{He didn't say. I was hoping you would know what it meant.}{}{5}{}{1340}{ }
{1340}{Something horrible must have happened after I ... after I ...[His voice trails off. He is obviously too distressed to continue.] Did he...did he say anything else?}{Something horrible must have happened after I ... after I ...[His voice trails off. He is obviously too distressed to continue.] Did he...did he say anything else?}{}{147}{}{ }
{1341}{He referred to you as a boy. Why would he do that?}{}{5}{}{90}{ }
{1350}{My mother died bringing me into this world. I believe my father died then as well, even though he continued to exist in the world for some eight more years. When he could stand living no longer, he took his own life.}{My mother died bringing me into this world. I believe my father died then as well, even though he continued to exist in the world for some eight more years. When he could stand living no longer, he took his own life.}{}{148}{}{ }
{1351}{But abandoning you like that...}{}{5}{}{1360}{ }
{1360}{He left me decently provided for, and with his grasp on reality becoming more tenuous each day, I believe he felt I would be safer in the care of others. [He shakes his head, sadly.] The last thing he did in this life was to give me that ring.}{He left me decently provided for, and with his grasp on reality becoming more tenuous each day, I believe he felt I would be safer in the care of others. [He shakes his head, sadly.] The last thing he did in this life was to give me that ring.}{}{149}{}{ }
{1361}{And then you gave it to Stennar?}{}{5}{}{1370}{ }
{1362}{That is quite sad. I've decided to explore the Black Mountain Clan for you, sir.}{}{5}{qu1014 2, qb1013 1}{470}{ }
{1363}{That is quite sad. I've decided to explore the Black Mountain Clan for you, sir.}{}{5}{qb1014 1, qb1013 1}{470}{qu1013 2 }
{1370}{That is how much his friendship meant to me. I was devastated when he disappeared with the rest of the clan. I believe I felt more deserted and alone then, than I did when my father killed himself.}{That is how much his friendship meant to me. I was devastated when he disappeared with the rest of the clan. I believe I felt more deserted and alone then, than I did when my father killed himself.}{}{150}{}{ }
{1371}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1379}{I must take my leave, good sir.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1380}{I do not know. But I am beginning to believe they are behind Stennar's death. This all seems to be pointing to my involvement with the Black Mountain Clan, doesn't it? That is why I feel it is imperative to find out their fate. Our lives seem to be dependent on it, in fact.}{I do not know. But I am beginning to believe they are behind Stennar's death. This all seems to be pointing to my involvement with the Black Mountain Clan, doesn't it? That is why I feel it is imperative to find out their fate. Our lives seem to be dependent on it, in fact.}{}{151}{}{ }
{1381}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1382}{Some of our lives more than others, eh?}{}{5}{}{1390}{ }
{1389}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1390}{[He looks at his enormous bodyguard.] Yes, it would seem that I am well protected here, but the more staff one has, the easier it is for one of them to be bribed or replaced with an assassin. Also, my notoriety keeps me a prisoner inside my house. They will always know where to look for me. You, on the other hand, can blend with the crowd, so to speak.}{[He looks at his enormous bodyguard.] Yes, it would seem that I am well protected here, but the more staff one has, the easier it is for one of them to be bribed or replaced with an assassin. Also, my notoriety keeps me a prisoner inside my house. They will always know where to look for me. You, on the other hand, can blend with the crowd, so to speak.}{}{152}{}{ }
{1391}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1394}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1395}{Well, as you know, I am the foremost manufacturer of steam engines in Arcanum, virtually without competition. I am working on a prototype for a smaller, more efficient engine right now, as a matter of fact. I also have various interests in other technological endeavors.}{Well, as you know, I am the foremost manufacturer of steam engines in Arcanum, virtually without competition. I am working on a prototype for a smaller, more efficient engine right now, as a matter of fact. I also have various interests in other technological endeavors.}{}{153}{}{ }
{1396}{How have you devastated your competition so?}{}{5}{}{1405}{ }
{1397}{Do you have any labor difficulties in your factories?}{}{5}{ra7}{1430}{re-5 }
{1398}{Do you have any labor difficulties in your factories?}{}{5}{ra-7}{1460}{ }
{1399}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1404}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1405}{It is not much of an accomplishment when old Cedric Appleby is your chief competitor. Poor Cedric. Always was a bit of a blundering fool. I really wish I could have convinced him to come work for me...}{It is not much of an accomplishment when old Cedric Appleby is your chief competitor. Poor Cedric. Always was a bit of a blundering fool. I really wish I could have convinced him to come work for me...}{}{154}{}{ }
{1406}{Why? I mean, if he's such an idiot?}{}{5}{}{1410}{ }
{1407}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1409}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1410}{Cedric and I were close friends when we were children. He was furious that I wouldn't introduce him to the dwarves...can you imagine? I had a difficult enough time gaining their respect without his simplemindedness. After I "invented" the steam engine he began to despise me. Strangely enough, I wish he was still my friend some days.}{Cedric and I were close friends when we were children. He was furious that I wouldn't introduce him to the dwarves...can you imagine? I had a difficult enough time gaining their respect without his simplemindedness. After I "invented" the steam engine he began to despise me. Strangely enough, I wish he was still my friend some days.}{}{155}{}{ }
{1411}{Appleby tried to hire me to steal something to expose you with.}{}{5}{qa1039 1, gf1012 0}{1420}{gf1012 1 }
{1414}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1419}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1420}{Cedric, you bastard! I tire of his games...sadly enough, I think it's time for someone to pay him a visit, before he finally gets up the nerve to start hiring people to kill me.}{Cedric, you bastard! I tire of his games...sadly enough, I think it's time for someone to pay him a visit, before he finally gets up the nerve to start hiring people to kill me.}{}{156}{}{ }
{1421}{Do you have any labor difficulties in your factories?}{}{5}{ra7}{1430}{re-5 }
{1422}{Do you have any labor difficulties in your factories?}{}{5}{ra-7}{1460}{ }
{1423}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1429}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1430}{[He looks at you suspiciously.] Why do you ask, [he pauses for effect]...halforc? You're not a labor sympathizer, are you? A "unionizer", perhaps? I can assure you, my workers are happy to have the jobs I give them. I treat your people better  than any other factory owner, of that I can assure you.}{[He looks at you suspiciously.] Why do you ask, [he pauses for effect]...halforc? You're not a labor sympathizer, are you? A "unionizer", perhaps? I can assure you, my workers are happy to have the jobs I give them. I treat your people better  than any other factory owner, of that I can assure you.}{}{157}{}{ }
{1431}{I didn't mean to imply anything, sir. Simply curious.}{}{5}{}{1440}{re+5 }
{1432}{I am sure you believe that, you racist oppressor.}{}{5}{}{1450}{re-10 }
{1433}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1439}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1440}{Yes, I can understand that, with all the talk of labor difficulties and protests in all the journals. But, in answer to your original question, I believe that I am fortunate to have been spared a lot of the problems others have been experiencing with their workers. I do believe it is because I treat my workers better than most. Why, their working conditions are almost human.}{Yes, I can understand that, with all the talk of labor difficulties and protests in all the journals. But, in answer to your original question, I believe that I am fortunate to have been spared a lot of the problems others have been experiencing with their workers. I do believe it is because I treat my workers better than most. Why, their working conditions are almost human.}{}{158}{}{ }
{1441}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1442}{I can take your pomposity no longer! Death to the bourgeoisie!}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 1050 ,co}
{1449}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1450}{How dare you, sir! I will not have subhuman labor agitators insult me in my own home!}{How dare you, madam! I will not have subhuman labor agitators insult me in my own home!}{}{159}{}{ }
{1451}{I apologize. Subhumans such as myself are prone to outbursts.}{}{5}{}{1455}{re+10 }
{1452}{I can take your pomposity no longer! Death to the bourgeoisie!}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 1050 ,co}
{1455}{Yes, yes, this is true. The lower races are lacking in restraint. I suppose your racial shortcomings are not your fault.}{Yes, yes, this is true. The lower races are lacking in restraint. I suppose your racial shortcomings are not your fault.}{}{160}{}{ }
{1456}{I must make an example of your bourgeoisie hide, swine!}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 1050 ,co}
{1457}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1459}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1460}{[He looks at you suspiciously.] Why do you ask? You're not a labor sympathizer, are you? A "unionizer", perhaps? I can assure you, my workers are happy to have the jobs I give them. I treat all orcs, true blood and half breed alike, better  than any other factory owner. Of that I can assure you.}{[He looks at you suspiciously.] Why do you ask? You're not a labor sympathizer, are you? A "unionizer", perhaps? I can assure you, my workers are happy to have the jobs I give them. I treat all orcs, true blood and half breed alike, better  than any other factory owner. Of that I can assure you.}{}{161}{}{ }
{1461}{I didn't mean to imply anything, sir. Simply curious.}{}{5}{}{1440}{re+5 }
{1462}{I am sure you believe that, you racist oppressor.}{}{5}{}{1470}{re-10 }
{1463}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1469}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1470}{How dare you! I will not have labor agitators insult me in my own home!}{How dare you! I will not have labor agitators insult me in my own home!}{}{162}{}{ }
{1471}{I apologize, sir. My outburst was uncalled for.}{}{5}{}{1475}{ }
{1472}{I can take your pomposity no longer! Death to the bourgeoisie!}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 1050 ,co}
{1475}{I suppose I can forgive your rudeness, this once.}{I suppose I can forgive your rudeness, this once.}{}{163}{}{ }
{1476}{K:}{}{5}{}{1290}{ }
{1479}{I appreciate your grace, sir. I must be off, though. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{1480}{I don't put much stock in religious ramblings. I'm more concerned with who killed Stennar, and why, and what all this has to do with my relationship with the Black Mountain Clan.}{I don't put much stock in religious ramblings. I'm more concerned with who killed Stennar, and why, and what all this has to do with my relationship with the Black Mountain Clan.}{}{164}{}{ }
{1481}{So what is to be done, now?}{}{5}{gf1007 1}{450}{ }
{1482}{So what is to be done, now?}{}{5}{gf1007 0}{1280}{ }
{1490}{I don't put much stock in religious ramblings, myself. But if you feel it could help you to get more information on the Panarii, you should go to their temple on the northern end of Lion's Head Circle.  I'm more concerned with who killed Stennar, and why, and what all this has to do with my relationship with the Black Mountain Clan.}{I don't put much stock in religious ramblings, myself. But if you feel it could help you to get more information on the Panarii, you should go to their temple on the northern end of Lion's Head Circle.  I'm more concerned with who killed Stennar, and why, and what all this has to do with my relationship with the Black Mountain Clan.}{}{165}{}{ru2154 }
{1491}{So what is to be done, now?}{}{5}{gf1007 1}{450}{ }
{1492}{So what is to be done, now?}{}{5}{gf1007 0}{1280}{ }
{1500}{It's ironic that my greatest mistake is that which brought me such wealth. As a youth, I was enamored of all things dwarven, so I sought out the nearest clan and attempted to impress them with my grasp of their technology. They laughed.}{It's ironic that my greatest mistake is that which brought me such wealth. As a youth, I was enamored of all things dwarven, so I sought out the nearest clan and attempted to impress them with my grasp of their technology. They laughed.}{}{166}{}{ }
{1501}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1502}{ }
{1502}{It was obviously a novelty to them, a ridiculous human who had a natural bent towards technology. I suppose it didn't help that I was a mere 14 years old at the time. I became something they humored to entertain themselves.}{It was obviously a novelty to them, a ridiculous human who had a natural bent towards technology. I suppose it didn't help that I was a mere 14 years old at the time. I became something they humored to entertain themselves.}{}{167}{}{ }
{1503}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1504}{ }
{1504}{Stennar was the only one who truly called me friend in all those years, and betrayal is how I repaid his friendship. It was he who first showed me their steam engine, as he knew I could appreciate the beautiful intricacies of its design.}{Stennar was the only one who truly called me friend in all those years, and betrayal is how I repaid his friendship. It was he who first showed me their steam engine, as he knew I could appreciate the beautiful intricacies of its design.}{}{168}{}{ }
{1505}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1506}{ }
{1506}{They had left it to rust in a corner, as they had very little use for a device that would reduce the need for sheer physical power. Imagine a dwarf relying on a device to do his digging for him! It's preposterous.}{They had left it to rust in a corner, as they had very little use for a device that would reduce the need for sheer physical power. Imagine a dwarf relying on a device to do his digging for him! It's preposterous.}{}{169}{}{ }
{1507}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1508}{ }
{1508}{I asked him if I could tinker with it, perhaps improve on it, as I knew this was the key to becoming truly a part of the dwarven world. I quickly devised a way to use it to power a pump for draining the mines.}{I asked him if I could tinker with it, perhaps improve on it, as I knew this was the key to becoming truly a part of the dwarven world. I quickly devised a way to use it to power a pump for draining the mines.}{}{170}{}{ }
{1509}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1510}{ }
{1510}{When I fell all over myself trying to explain it to them, laughter was, once again, their only response. I knew I had to somehow gain their respect, so I hastily sketched some schematics and set out to prove my theory.}{When I fell all over myself trying to explain it to them, laughter was, once again, their only response. I knew I had to somehow gain their respect, so I hastily sketched some schematics and set out to prove my theory.}{}{171}{}{ }
{1511}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1512}{ }
{1512}{The struggling human mining company that I brought the plans to offered me a share in their mines for the steam pump! I was ecstatic - I had not a care for their mines or their money, I desired vindication!}{The struggling human mining company that I brought the plans to offered me a share in their mines for the steam pump! I was ecstatic - I had not a care for their mines or their money, I desired vindication!}{}{172}{}{ }
{1513}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1514}{ }
{1514}{When I returned to the dwarves to boast of my accomplishments and be welcomed into their clan ... they were gone. The inventions came quickly after that, fueled by my anger and confusion.}{When I returned to the dwarves to boast of my accomplishments and be welcomed into their clan ... they were gone. The inventions came quickly after that, fueled by my anger and confusion.}{}{173}{}{ }
{1515}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1516}{ }
{1516}{How could they have denied me my place amongst them after all my labors? Somehow, I felt I could still prove myself to them. I continued searching for them in all my spare moments, but to no avail. But then, they came - the robed ones.}{How could they have denied me my place amongst them after all my labors? Somehow, I felt I could still prove myself to them. I continued searching for them in all my spare moments, but to no avail. But then, they came - the robed ones.}{}{174}{}{ }
{1517}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{1518}{ }
{1518}{They appeared to me late one night and they warned me to never speak of, nor try to find, the dwarves again. Still being a mere lad, you can imagine the terror that put into me. As my wealth and power grew, I shook off some of my youthful fear and hired the first in a long chain of investigators to locate Stennar and his clan.}{They appeared to me late one night and they warned me to never speak of, nor try to find, the dwarves again. Still being a mere lad, you can imagine the terror that put into me. As my wealth and power grew, I shook off some of my youthful fear and hired the first in a long chain of investigators to locate Stennar and his clan.}{}{175}{}{ }
{1519}{[Continue]}{}{1}{}{-46}{ }

